meta {
  name: Create Department
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/departments
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "company_id": 1,
    "code": "DEP-01",
    "department_name": "Recursos Humanos",
    "manager_employee_id": null,
    "status": "active"
  }
}

docs {
  Requeridos: `company_id`, `code`, `department_name`. `manager_employee_id` es opcional (acepta `null`). `status` es opcional (default `active`).

  Errores: `422 INVALID_COMPANY` / `INVALID_MANAGER` si los ids no existen; `409 DEPARTMENT_CODE_EXISTS` si `code` ya esta en uso dentro de la empresa.
}
